<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWITZERLAND BEAT ARGENTINA 5-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWITZERLAND BEAT ARGENTINA 5-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland beat Argentina 5-0 in their Fed Cup World Group two tie on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results (Swiss names first)</p>
<p>Martina Hingis beat Florencia Labat 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder beat Marie Jose Gaidano 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Hingis/Emmanuelle Gagliardi beat Mercedes Paz/Laura Montalvo 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
